OL,3,GNEWSAResidents hail Community Connect a
OL,4,Asuccess
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in the south of the Isle of
OL,7,FMan has hailed a Community Connect
OL,8,Fevent a success after it delivered in
OL,9,Fbringing care closer to home.
OL,11,FFor the first time, the health and care
OL,12,Fcommunity initiative was held at Thie
OL,13,FRosien in Port Erin.
OL,15,FRoss Keat, a consultant from Public
OL,16,FHealth Isle of Man, said the aim was to
OL,17,Fshow that help is readily available in
OL,18,Feach part of the island and not just
OL,19,F"centred around Douglas or the
OL,20,Fhospital".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
