OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Doreen Christian, who faces
OL,7,Flonlieness and isolation in the darker
OL,8,Fcolder months, a meeting with the
OL,9,FSouthern Befrienders means she will not
OL,10,Fbe lonely this winter.
